
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>XYZ Salon | Luxury Beauty & Grooming</title>
<meta name="description" content="XYZ Salon - Premium luxury salon services for men and women. Hair styling, makeup, bridal packages, spa treatments & more. Book your appointment today!">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
<style>
:root {
--rose-gold: #b76e79;
--rose-gold-light: #e8c4c8;
--rose-gold-dark: #8b4a52;
--soft-pink: #fce4ec;
--soft-pink-deep: #f8bbd0;
--cream: #faf7f2;
--beige: #f5ebe0;
--gold: #d4af37;
--gold-light: #f4e4a6;
--black: #1a1a1a;
--charcoal: #2d2d2d;
--white: #ffffff;
--gray: #6b6b6b;
--light-gray: #f0f0f0;
}
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 80px; }
body { font-family: 'DM Sans', 'Poppins', sans-serif; color: var(--charcoal); background: var(--cream); overflow-x: hidden; line-height: 1.7; }
h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; }
::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--cream); }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--rose-gold); border-radius: 4px; }
@keyframes fadeInUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
@keyframes float { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-15px); } }
@keyframes pulse { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(183,110,121,0.4); } 50% { transform: scale(1.05); box-shadow: 0 0 0 15px rgba(183,110,121,0); } }
@keyframes shimmer { 0% { background-position: -200% center; } 100% { background-position: 200% center; } }
.reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1); }
.reveal.active { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
.reveal-left { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-60px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1); }
.reveal-left.active { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
.reveal-right { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(60px); transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1); }
.reveal-right.active { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
.navbar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; z-index: 1000; padding: 18px 0; transition: all 0.4s ease; }
.navbar.scrolled { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); box-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); padding: 12px 0; }
.navbar.scrolled .nav-link { color: var(--charcoal); }
.navbar.scrolled .logo-text { color: var(--rose-gold-dark); }
.nav-container { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 30px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
.logo-text { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 2px; transition: color 0.3s; }
.logo-text span { color: var(--gold); }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 35px; list-style: none; }
.nav-link { color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.5px; position: relative; transition: color 0.3s; padding: 5px 0; }
.nav-link::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 0; height: 2px; background: var(--gold); transition: width 0.3s ease; }
.nav-link:hover::after { width: 100%; }
.nav-link:hover { color: var(--gold); }
.nav-cta { background: var(--rose-gold); color: var(--white); padding: 10px 28px; border-radius: 30px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: all 0.3s ease; border: 2px solid var(--rose-gold); }
.nav-cta:hover { background: transparent; color: var(--rose-gold); }
.navbar.scrolled .nav-cta { background: var(--rose-gold); color: var(--white); }
.navbar.scrolled .nav-cta:hover { background: transparent; color: var(--rose-gold); }
.mobile-menu-btn { display: none; background: none; border: none; color: var(--white); font-size: 1.5rem; cursor: pointer; }
.navbar.scrolled .mobile-menu-btn { color: var(--charcoal); }
.hero { min-height: 100vh; position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a0a0c 0%, #2d1a1e 50%, #1a0a0c 100%); }
.hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560066984-138dadb4c035?w=1920&q=80') center/cover no-repeat; opacity: 0.4; }
.hero-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,10,12,0.85) 0%, rgba(45,26,30,0.7) 50%, rgba(26,10,12,0.9) 100%); }
.hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; text-align: center; max-width: 900px; padding: 0 30px; }
.hero-subtitle { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 20px; animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 0.2s both; }
.hero-title { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 20px; animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 0.4s both; text-shadow: 0 4px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
.hero-title span { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--rose-gold-light), var(--gold)); background-size: 200% auto; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; animation: shimmer 3s linear infinite; }
.hero-desc { font-size: 1.15rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 600px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 0.6s both; }
.hero-buttons { display: flex; gap: 20px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 0.8s both; }
.btn-primary { background: var(--rose-gold); color: var(--white); padding: 16px 40px; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem; border: 2px solid var(--rose-gold); transition: all 0.4s ease; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; cursor: pointer; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.btn-primary::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: -100%; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), transparent); transition: left 0.5s; }
.btn-primary:hover::before { left: 100%; }
.btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(183,110,121,0.4); }
.btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: var(--white); padding: 16px 40px; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1rem; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); transition: all 0.4s ease; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; cursor: pointer; }
.btn-secondary:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); transform: translateY(-3px); }
.hero-reviews { margin-top: 50px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; animation: fadeInUp 1s ease 1s both; }
.stars { color: var(--gold); font-size: 1.2rem; }
.review-text { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-size: 0.95rem; }
.review-text strong { color: var(--white); }
.section { padding: 100px 0; position: relative; }
.section-header { text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 60px; padding: 0 20px; }
.section-tag { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--rose-gold); margin-bottom: 15px; display: inline-block; position: relative; }
.section-tag::before, .section-tag::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 50%; width: 40px; height: 1px; background: var(--rose-gold); }
.section-tag::before { right: calc(100% + 15px); }
.section-tag::after { left: calc(100% + 15px); }
.section-title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); color: var(--black); margin-bottom: 15px; }
.section-title span { color: var(--rose-gold); }
.section-desc { color: var(--gray); font-size: 1.05rem; }
.container { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 30px; }
.about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center; }
.about-images { position: relative; }
.about-img-main { width: 100%; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); transition: transform 0.5s ease; }
.about-img-main:hover { transform: scale(1.02); }
.about-img-float { position: absolute; width: 200px; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border: 5px solid var(--white); animation: float 5s ease-in-out infinite; }
.about-img-float.img-1 { bottom: -30px; right: -20px; }
.about-img-float.img-2 { top: -20px; left: -20px; width: 150px; animation-delay: 2s; }
.about-content h3 { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--black); }
.about-content p { color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
.about-features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 15px; margin-top: 30px; }
.about-feature { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.about-feature i { width: 40px; height: 40px; background: var(--soft-pink); color: var(--rose-gold); border-radius: 10px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.about-feature span { font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--charcoal); }
.stats-section { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rose-gold-dark) 0%, var(--rose-gold) 100%); padding: 80px 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.stats-section::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="1" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.1)"/></svg>'); background-size: 30px 30px; }
.stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 40px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.stat-item { text-align: center; color: var(--white); }
.stat-number { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1; }
.stat-label { font-size: 1rem; opacity: 0.9; font-weight: 500; }
.services-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
.service-card { background: var(--white); border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1); position: relative; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); cursor: pointer; }
.service-card::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 4px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--rose-gold), var(--gold)); transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; transition: transform 0.4s ease; }
.service-card:hover::before { transform: scaleX(1); }
.service-card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
.service-icon { width: 80px; height: 80px; background: var(--soft-pink); border-radius: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 25px; font-size: 2rem; color: var(--rose-gold); transition: all 0.4s ease; }
.service-card:hover .service-icon { background: var(--rose-gold); color: var(--white); transform: rotateY(180deg); }
.service-card h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--black); }
.service-card p { color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; }
.why-section { background: var(--beige); }
.why-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
.why-card { background: var(--white); padding: 35px; border-radius: 20px; display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start; transition: all 0.4s ease; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
.why-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
.why-icon { width: 55px; height: 55px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rose-gold), var(--rose-gold-light)); border-radius: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--white); font-size: 1.3rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.why-content h4 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--black); }
.why-content p { color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.95rem; }
.gallery-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); grid-auto-rows: 280px; gap: 15px; }
.gallery-item { position: relative; border-radius: 15px; overflow: hidden; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.4s ease; }
.gallery-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.6s ease; }
.gallery-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.1); }
.gallery-item::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(183,110,121,0); transition: background 0.4s ease; }
.gallery-item:hover::after { background: rgba(183,110,121,0.3); }
.gallery-item .gallery-zoom { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0); width: 50px; height: 50px; background: var(--white); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--rose-gold); font-size: 1.2rem; z-index: 2; transition: all 0.4s ease; }
.gallery-item:hover .gallery-zoom { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); }
.gallery-item.tall { grid-row: span 2; }
.gallery-item.wide { grid-column: span 2; }
.lightbox { display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.95); z-index: 2000; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; }
.lightbox.active { display: flex; }
.lightbox img { max-width: 90%; max-height: 90%; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
.lightbox-close { position: absolute; top: 30px; right: 30px; color: var(--white); font-size: 2rem; cursor: pointer; width: 50px; height: 50px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: all 0.3s; }
.lightbox-close:hover { background: var(--rose-gold); }
.reviews-section { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--soft-pink) 0%, var(--cream) 100%); }
.reviews-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
.review-card { background: var(--white); padding: 40px; border-radius: 20px; position: relative; transition: all 0.4s ease; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
.review-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
.review-card::before { content: '"'; position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 30px; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 5rem; color: var(--soft-pink-deep); line-height: 1; }
.review-stars { color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 1rem; }
.review-text { color: var(--gray); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px; font-style: italic; }
.review-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; }
.review-avatar { width: 50px; height: 50px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 3px solid var(--soft-pink); }
.review-name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--black); font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
.review-role { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gray); }
.offers-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; }
.offer-card { background: var(--white); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; transition: all 0.4s ease; position: relative; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
.offer-card:hover { transform: translateY(-8px); box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); }
.offer-badge { position: absolute; top: 20px; left: -35px; background: var(--gold); color: var(--black); padding: 8px 50px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; transform: rotate(-45deg); z-index: 2; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
.offer-img { width: 100%; height: 220px; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.5s ease; }
.offer-card:hover .offer-img { transform: scale(1.08); }
.offer-content { padding: 30px; }
.offer-content h3 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--black); }
.offer-content p { color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.offer-price { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; }
.offer-price .old { text-decoration: line-through; color: var(--gray); font-size: 1rem; }
.offer-price .new { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--rose-gold); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }
.team-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 35px; }
.team-card { background: var(--white); border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; text-align: center; transition: all 0.4s ease; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
.team-card:hover { transform: translateY(-8px); box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
.team-img-wrap { position: relative; overflow: hidden; height: 320px; }
.team-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.5s ease; }
.team-card:hover .team-img { transform: scale(1.08); }
.team-social { position: absolute; bottom: -50px; left: 0; right: 0; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; padding: 15px; background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.7), transparent); transition: bottom 0.4s ease; }
.team-card:hover .team-social { bottom: 0; }
.team-social a { width: 38px; height: 38px; background: var(--white); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--rose-gold); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s; }
.team-social a:hover { background: var(--rose-gold); color: var(--white); }
.team-info { padding: 25px; }
.team-info h4 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--black); }
.team-info .role { color: var(--rose-gold); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 5px; }
.team-info .exp { color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.85rem; }
.booking-section { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--charcoal) 0%, var(--black) 100%); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
.booking-section::before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -50%; right: -20%; width: 600px; height: 600px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(183,110,121,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%); border-radius: 50%; }
.booking-section .section-title, .booking-section .section-desc { color: var(--white); }
.booking-section .section-tag { color: var(--gold); }
.booking-section .section-tag::before, .booking-section .section-tag::after { background: var(--gold); }
.booking-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.booking-info h3 { font-size: 2rem; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 20px; }
.booking-info p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 1.05rem; }
.booking-contact { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
.booking-contact-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 15px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); }
.booking-contact-item i { width: 45px; height: 45px; background: rgba(183,110,121,0.2); border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--rose-gold-light); font-size: 1.1rem; }
.booking-form { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 25px; padding: 50px; }
.form-group { margin-bottom: 20px; }
.form-group label { display: block; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500; }
.form-group input, .form-group select, .form-group textarea { width: 100%; padding: 14px 18px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 12px; color: var(--white); font-size: 1rem; font-family: inherit; transition: all 0.3s; }
.form-group input:focus, .form-group select:focus, .form-group textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--rose-gold); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }
.form-group input::placeholder, .form-group textarea::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
.form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
.form-group textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 100px; }
.booking-buttons { display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 10px; }
.btn-whatsapp { background: #25d366; color: var(--white); padding: 14px 30px; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; transition: all 0.3s; border: 2px solid #25d366; cursor: pointer; }
.btn-whatsapp:hover { background: transparent; transform: translateY(-2px); }
.btn-call { background: transparent; color: var(--white); padding: 14px 30px; border-radius: 50px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; transition: all 0.3s; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); cursor: pointer; }
.btn-call:hover { border-color: var(--gold); color: var(--gold); transform: translateY(-2px); }
.contact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: stretch; }
.contact-info { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 25px; }
.contact-card { background: var(--white); padding: 30px; border-radius: 20px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px; transition: all 0.4s ease; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
.contact-card:hover { transform: translateX(5px); box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
.contact-icon { width: 55px; height: 55px; background: var(--soft-pink); border-radius: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--rose-gold); font-size: 1.3rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.contact-card h4 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--black); }
.contact-card p { color: var(--gray); font-size: 0.95rem; }
.contact-map { border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); height: 100%; min-height: 400px; }
.contact-map iframe { width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; min-height: 400px; }
.faq-section { background: var(--beige); }
.faq-list { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
.faq-item { background: var(--white); border-radius: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); transition: all 0.3s; }
.faq-item:hover { box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
.faq-question { padding: 25px 30px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; color: var(--black); font-size: 1.05rem; transition: color 0.3s; }
.faq-question:hover { color: var(--rose-gold); }
.faq-question i { transition: transform 0.3s; color: var(--rose-gold); }
.faq-item.active .faq-question i { transform: rotate(180deg); }
.faq-answer { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.4s ease, padding 0.4s ease; }
.faq-item.active .faq-answer { max-height: 300px; padding: 0 30px 25px; }
.faq-answer p { color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.8; }
.footer { background: var(--black); color: var(--white); padding: 80px 0 30px; position: relative; }
.footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1.5fr; gap: 50px; margin-bottom: 50px; }
.footer-brand .logo-text { color: var(--white); font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 20px; display: inline-block; }
.footer-brand p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px; }
.footer-social { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
.footer-social a { width: 42px; height: 42px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--white); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s; }
.footer-social a:hover { background: var(--rose-gold); transform: translateY(-3px); }
.footer-col h4 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 25px; color: var(--white); position: relative; padding-bottom: 10px; }
.footer-col h4::after { content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 40px; height: 2px; background: var(--rose-gold); }
.footer-links { list-style: none; }
.footer-links li { margin-bottom: 12px; }
.footer-links a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.footer-links a:hover { color: var(--rose-gold); padding-left: 5px; }
.footer-contact p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.footer-contact i { color: var(--rose-gold); width: 20px; }
.footer-bottom { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-top: 30px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px; }
.footer-bottom p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size: 0.9rem; }
.footer-bottom-links { display: flex; gap: 25px; }
.footer-bottom-links a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: color 0.3s; }
.footer-bottom-links a:hover { color: var(--rose-gold); }
.floating-btn { position: fixed; right: 25px; width: 55px; height: 55px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--white); font-size: 1.4rem; text-decoration: none; z-index: 999; box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); transition: all 0.3s ease; animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
.floating-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }
.float-whatsapp { bottom: 100px; background: #25d366; }
.float-call { bottom: 170px; background: var(--rose-gold); animation-delay: 0.5s; }
.scroll-top { position: fixed; bottom: 30px; right: 25px; width: 50px; height: 50px; background: var(--rose-gold); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--white); font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; z-index: 999; border: none; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: all 0.3s; box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
.scroll-top.visible { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }
.scroll-top:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); background: var(--rose-gold-dark); }
.mobile-menu { position: fixed; top: 0; right: -100%; width: 320px; height: 100vh; background: var(--white); z-index: 1100; padding: 80px 30px 30px; transition: right 0.4s ease; box-shadow: -10px 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
.mobile-menu.active { right: 0; }
.mobile-menu-overlay { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); z-index: 1050; opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transition: all 0.3s; }
.mobile-menu-overlay.active { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; }
.mobile-menu-close { position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 20px; background: none; border: none; font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--charcoal); cursor: pointer; }
.mobile-nav-links { list-style: none; }
.mobile-nav-links li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
.mobile-nav-links a { display: block; padding: 15px; color: var(--charcoal); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; border-radius: 10px; transition: all 0.3s; }
.mobile-nav-links a:hover { background: var(--soft-pink); color: var(--rose-gold); }
.mobile-nav-cta { display: block; margin-top: 20px; background: var(--rose-gold); color: var(--white); padding: 15px; border-radius: 50px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
.loader { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: var(--cream); z-index: 5000; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-direction: column; transition: opacity 0.5s, visibility 0.5s; }
.loader.hidden { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; }
.loader-logo { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--rose-gold); margin-bottom: 30px; animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease; }
.loader-bar { width: 200px; height: 3px; background: var(--soft-pink); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }
.loader-progress { width: 0%; height: 100%; background: var(--rose-gold); border-radius: 3px; animation: loadProgress 1.5s ease forwards; }
@keyframes loadProgress { 0% { width: 0%; } 100% { width: 100%; } }
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
.about-grid, .booking-grid, .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
.stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
.gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
.gallery-item.tall, .gallery-item.wide { grid-row: span 1; grid-column: span 1; }
.footer-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
.nav-links, .nav-cta { display: none; }
.mobile-menu-btn { display: block; }
.stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; }
.stat-number { font-size: 2.5rem; }
.gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-auto-rows: 250px; }
.footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
.about-features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
.form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
.hero-buttons { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
.booking-buttons { flex-direction: column; }
.section { padding: 60px 0; }
.about-img-float { display: none; }
.floating-btn { width: 48px; height: 48px; font-size: 1.2rem; right: 15px; }
.float-whatsapp { bottom: 80px; }
.float-call { bottom: 140px; }
.scroll-top { bottom: 20px; right: 15px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
 
<div class="loader" id="loader">
<div class="loader-logo">XYZ <span style="color:var(--gold)">Salon</span></div>
<div class="loader-bar"><div class="loader-progress"></div></div>
</div>
<nav class="navbar" id="navbar">
<div class="nav-container">
<a href="#" class="logo-text">XYZ <span>Salon</span></a>
<ul class="nav-links">
<li><a href="#home" class="nav-link">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="#about" class="nav-link">About</a></li>
<li><a href="#services" class="nav-link">Services</a></li>
<li><a href="#gallery" class="nav-link">Gallery</a></li>
<li><a href="#reviews" class="nav-link">Reviews</a></li>
<li><a href="#team" class="nav-link">Team</a></li>
<li><a href="#booking" class="nav-link">Book Now</a></li>
<li><a href="#contact" class="nav-link">Contact</a></li>
</ul>
<a href="#booking" class="nav-cta">Book Appointment</a>
<button class="mobile-menu-btn" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()"><i class="fas fa-bars"></i></button>
</div>
</nav>
<div class="mobile-menu-overlay" id="mobileOverlay" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()"></div>
<div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
<button class="mobile-menu-close" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button>
<ul class="mobile-nav-links">
<li><a href="#home" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="#about" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">About Us</a></li>
<li><a href="#services" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Services</a></li>
<li><a href="#gallery" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Gallery</a></li>
<li><a href="#reviews" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Reviews</a></li>
<li><a href="#team" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Our Team</a></li>
<li><a href="#offers" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Offers</a></li>
<li><a href="#booking" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Book Now</a></li>
<li><a href="#contact" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Contact</a></li>
</ul>
<a href="#booking" class="mobile-nav-cta" onclick="toggleMobileMenu()">Book Appointment</a>
</div>
<section class="hero" id="home">
<div class="hero-bg"></div>
<div class="hero-overlay"></div>
<div class="hero-content">
<p class="hero-subtitle">Welcome to XYZ Salon</p>
<h1 class="hero-title">Reveal Your <span>True Beauty</span></h1>
<p class="hero-desc">Luxury salon services for women and men with expert stylists, premium products, and a serene ambiance that transforms every visit into an experience.</p>
<div class="hero-buttons">
<a href="#booking" class="btn-primary"><i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i> Book Appointment</a>
<a href="tel:09876543210" class="btn-secondary"><i class="fas fa-phone"></i> Call Now</a>
</div>
<div class="hero-reviews">
<div class="stars"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
<p class="review-text"><strong>105+</strong> Five-Star Google Reviews</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="about">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-header reveal">
<span class="section-tag">About Us</span>
<h2 class="section-title">Your Beauty, <span>Our Passion</span></h2>
<p class="section-desc">Experience the perfect blend of luxury, expertise, and personalized care at XYZ Salon.</p>
</div>
<div class="about-grid">
<div class="about-images reveal-left">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522337360788-8b13dee7a37e?w=600&q=80" alt="Salon Interior" class="about-img-main">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1595476108010-b4d1f102b1b1?w=300&q=80" alt="Hair Styling" class="about-img-float img-1">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516975080664-ed2fc6a32937?w=300&q=80" alt="Makeup" class="about-img-float img-2">
</div>
<div class="about-content reveal-right">
<h3>Where Elegance Meets Excellence</h3>
<p>At XYZ Salon, we believe that beauty is not just about looking good, it is about feeling confident, empowered, and truly yourself. Since our establishment, we have been dedicated to providing world-class salon services that cater to your unique style and personality.</p>
<p>Our team of highly skilled professionals uses only premium, internationally acclaimed products to ensure that every treatment delivers exceptional results. From the moment you step into our luxurious space, you will be enveloped in an atmosphere of tranquility and sophistication.</p>
<div class="about-features">
<div class="about-feature"><i class="fas fa-award"></i><span>10+ Years Excellence</span></div>
<div class="about-feature"><i class="fas fa-user-tie"></i><span>Expert Stylists</span></div>
<div class="about-feature"><i class="fas fa-sparkles"></i><span>Premium Products</span></div>
<div class="about-feature"><i class="fas fa-shield-virus"></i><span>Hygiene First</span></div>
<div class="about-feature"><i class="fas fa-couch"></i><span>Luxury Ambiance</span></div>
<div class="about-feature"><i class="fas fa-heart"></i><span>100% Satisfaction</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="stats-section">
<div class="container">
<div class="stats-grid">
<div class="stat-item reveal"><div class="stat-number" data-count="10">0</div><div class="stat-label">Years of Excellence</div></div>
<div class="stat-item reveal"><div class="stat-number" data-count="5000">0</div><div class="stat-label">Happy Clients</div></div>
<div class="stat-item reveal"><div class="stat-number" data-count="25">0</div><div class="stat-label">Expert Stylists</div></div>
<div class="stat-item reveal"><div class="stat-number" data-count="18">0</div><div class="stat-label">Premium Services</div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="services">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-header reveal">
<span class="section-tag">Our Services</span>
<h2 class="section-title">Premium <span>Beauty Services</span></h2>
<p class="section-desc">Discover our wide range of luxury treatments designed to enhance your natural beauty.</p>
</div>
<div class="services-grid">
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-cut"></i></div><h3>Hair Cut</h3><p>Precision cuts tailored to your face shape and personal style by our expert stylists.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-wind"></i></div><h3>Hair Styling</h3><p>From elegant updos to beach waves, we create stunning styles for every occasion.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-palette"></i></div><h3>Hair Coloring</h3><p>Vibrant colors, balayage, highlights, and global coloring with premium ammonia-free dyes.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-spa"></i></div><h3>Hair Spa</h3><p>Deep conditioning treatments that nourish, repair, and revitalize your hair from root to tip.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-magic"></i></div><h3>Keratin Treatment</h3><p>Smooth, frizz-free, and silky hair with our advanced keratin and protein treatments.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-water"></i></div><h3>Smoothening</h3><p>Professional hair smoothening and straightening for that sleek, polished look.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-face-smile"></i></div><h3>Facial</h3><p>Rejuvenating facials using premium skincare products for a glowing, youthful complexion.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-droplet"></i></div><h3>Cleanup</h3><p>Deep pore cleansing treatments that remove impurities and leave your skin fresh.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-sun"></i></div><h3>Bleach</h3><p>Safe and effective skin lightening treatments for an even, radiant skin tone.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-crown"></i></div><h3>Bridal Makeup</h3><p>Exquisite bridal makeup that makes you look and feel like royalty on your special day.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-glass-cheers"></i></div><h3>Party Makeup</h3><p>Glamorous makeup looks perfect for parties, events, and celebrations.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-hand-sparkles"></i></div><h3>Nail Art</h3><p>Creative nail art designs from minimalistic to elaborate, using high-quality polishes.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-hand"></i></div><h3>Manicure</h3><p>Luxury manicure services to keep your hands soft, beautiful, and well-groomed.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-shoe-prints"></i></div><h3>Pedicure</h3><p>Relaxing pedicure treatments for soft, smooth, and beautiful feet.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-feather"></i></div><h3>Waxing</h3><p>Full-body waxing with premium wax for smooth, hair-free skin with minimal discomfort.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i></div><h3>Threading</h3><p>Precision eyebrow shaping and facial hair removal for perfectly defined features.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-hands"></i></div><h3>Head Massage</h3><p>Relaxing head and scalp massages that relieve stress and promote hair health.</p></div>
<div class="service-card reveal"><div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-user"></i></div><h3>Beard Grooming</h3><p>Professional beard trimming, shaping, and grooming for a sharp, refined look.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section why-section" id="why">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-header reveal">
<span class="section-tag">Why Choose Us</span>
<h2 class="section-title">The XYZ <span>Difference</span></h2>
<p class="section-desc">We go above and beyond to ensure every client leaves our salon feeling beautiful and confident.</p>
</div>
<div class="why-grid">
<div class="why-card reveal"><div class="why-icon"><i class="fas fa-user-tie"></i></div><div class="why-content"><h4>Professional Stylists</h4><p>Our team comprises certified experts with years of experience in the latest beauty trends and techniques.</p></div></div>
<div class="why-card reveal"><div class="why-icon"><i class="fas fa-gem"></i></div><div class="why-content"><h4>Premium Products</h4><p>We use only internationally renowned, high-quality products that are gentle on your skin and hair.</p></div></div>
<div class="why-card reveal"><div class="why-icon"><i class="fas fa-shield-virus"></i></div><div class="why-content"><h4>Hygienic Environment</h4><p>Our salon maintains the highest standards of cleanliness and sanitization for your safety and comfort.</p></div></div>
<div class="why-card reveal"><div class="why-icon"><i class="fas fa-tags"></i></div><div class="why-content"><h4>Affordable Pricing</h4><p>Luxury services at competitive prices with regular offers and packages for everyone.</p></div></div>
<div class="why-card reveal"><div class="why-icon"><i class="fas fa-heart"></i></div><div class="why-content"><h4>Personalized Care</h4><p>Every client receives a customized treatment plan based on their unique needs and preferences.</p></div></div>
<div class="why-card reveal"><div class="why-icon"><i class="fas fa-fire"></i></div><div class="why-content"><h4>Latest Trends</h4><p>We stay ahead of the curve with continuous training in the newest beauty and fashion trends.</p></div></div>
<div class="why-card reveal"><div class="why-icon"><i class="fas fa-couch"></i></div><div class="why-content"><h4>Comfortable Experience</h4><p>Relax in our luxurious, serene environment designed to make your visit truly enjoyable.</p></div></div>
<div class="why-card reveal"><div class="why-icon"><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div><div class="why-content"><h4>100% Satisfaction</h4><p>Your happiness is our priority. We ensure every service exceeds your expectations.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section" id="gallery">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-header reveal">
<span class="section-tag">Gallery</span>
<h2 class="section-title">Our <span>Work</span></h2>
<p class="section-desc">Browse through our portfolio of stunning transformations and salon moments.</p>
</div>
<div class="gallery-grid">
<div class="gallery-item wide reveal" onclick="openLightbox(this)"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522337360788-8b13dee7a37e?w=800&q=80" alt="Salon"><div class="gallery-zoom"><i class="fas fa-search-plus"></i></div></div>
<div class="gallery-item tall reveal" onclick="openLightbox(this)"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560066984-138dadb4c035?w=600&q=80" alt="Hair Styling"><div class="gallery-zoom"><i class="fas fa-search-plus"></i></div></div>
<div class="gallery-item reveal" onclick="openLightbox(this)"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487412912498-0447578fcca8?w=600&q=80" alt="Makeup"><div class="gallery-zoom"><i class="fas fa-search-plus"></i></div></div>
<div class="gallery-item reveal" onclick="openLightbox(this)"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604654894610-df63bc536371?w=600&q=80" alt="Nail Art"><div class="gallery-zoom"><i class="fas fa-search-plus"></i></div></div>
<div class="gallery-item reveal" onclick="openLightbox(this)"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516975080664-ed2fc6a32937?w=600&q=80" alt="Facial"><div class="gallery-zoom"><i class="fas fa-search-plus"></i></div></div>
<div class="gallery-item wide reveal" onclick="openLightbox(this)"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1527799820374-dcf8d9d4a388?w=800&q=80" alt="Bridal"><div class="gallery-zoom"><i class="fas fa-search-plus"></i></div></div>
<div class="gallery-item reveal" onclick="openLightbox(this)"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1595476108010-b4d1f102b1b1?w=600&q=80" alt="Products"><div class="gallery-zoom"><i class="fas fa-search-plus"></i></div></div>
<div class="gallery-item reveal" onclick="openLightbox(this)"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633681926022-84c23e8cb2d6?w=600&q=80" alt="Interior"><div class="gallery-zoom"><i class="fas fa-search-plus"></i></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="lightbox" id="lightbox" onclick="closeLightbox()">
<span class="lightbox-close"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></span>
<img src="" alt="Gallery" id="lightboxImg">
</div>
 
<section class="section reviews-section" id="reviews">
<div class="container">
<div class="section-header reveal">
<span class="section-tag">Testimonials</span>
<h2 class="section-title">What Our <span>Clients Say</span></h2>
<p class="section-desc">Real stories from real clients who have experienced the XYZ Salon difference.</p>
</div>
<div class="reviews-grid">
<div class="review-card reveal">
<div class="review-stars"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
<p class="review-text">"Absolutely loved my experience at XYZ Salon! The staff was incredibly professional and the ambiance was so relaxing. My hair has never looked better. Highly recommend!"</p>
<div class="review-author">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?w=100&q=80" alt="Priya Sharma" class="review-avatar">
<div><div class="review-name">Priya Sharma</div><div class="review-role">Regular Client</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="review-card reveal">
<div class="review-stars"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
<p class="review-text">"I got my bridal makeup done here and I was blown away! The makeup artist understood exactly what I wanted. I felt like a princess on my wedding day."</p>
<div class="review-author">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1438761681033-6461ffad8d80?w=100&q=80" alt="Ananya Patel" class="review-avatar">
<div><div class="review-name">Ananya Patel</div><div class="review-role">Bridal Client</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="review-card reveal">
<div class="review-stars"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
<p class="review-text">"Best salon in Camp! The keratin treatment transformed my frizzy hair into silky smooth locks. The staff is warm, the place is spotless, and the prices are fair."</p>
