<div class="faq-list">
<div class="faq-item reveal" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
<div class="faq-question">Do I need to book an appointment in advance? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>While walk-ins are welcome, we highly recommend booking an appointment in advance to ensure you get your preferred time slot and stylist. You can book online through our website or call us directly.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item reveal" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
<div class="faq-question">What products do you use for treatments? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>We use only premium, internationally renowned brands like L'Oreal, Schwarzkopf, Wella, and Kerastase. All our products are carefully selected to be gentle yet effective on your skin and hair.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item reveal" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
<div class="faq-question">How long does a bridal makeup session take? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>A complete bridal makeup session typically takes 3-4 hours, which includes skin prep, base makeup, eye makeup, hairstyling, and final touches. We recommend scheduling a trial session beforehand.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item reveal" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
<div class="faq-question">What is your cancellation policy? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>We understand plans can change. Please inform us at least 24 hours in advance if you need to cancel or reschedule your appointment. Late cancellations may incur a nominal fee.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item reveal" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
<div class="faq-question">Do you offer gift cards or vouchers? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes! We offer beautifully designed gift cards and vouchers that make perfect presents for birthdays, anniversaries, or any special occasion. Gift cards can be purchased at the salon or online.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item reveal" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
<div class="faq-question">Is parking available near the salon? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div>
<div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes, we have convenient parking options available near our salon location in Camp. Our staff will be happy to guide you to the nearest parking area when you arrive.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
